I used to run an AS2100A 5/375 side to side to an old SMP PPro 200/512K by
Dec. I found the PC to be, as a whole, slower than the Alpha, especcialy 
on FP intensive code, but also on completely int code like postgreSQL, the
respose times where twice as fast on the alpha, (Same amount of RAM, same
database, same load = nil, same query). If you have both, use them!

