PCI Diamond Stealth 2000 2mb Video.
PCI SMC 10\100 nic.
PCI Symbios SCSI controller card.
Gateway Vivitron svga monitor 75hz at 1024 and max 120 vert.
I have 2 2gig SCSI hard drives for FreeBSD with /usr on one and
everything else on the other
No ISA cards.

